{
  "_about": "Which Mixamo FBX files become game clips, and how. Read by lab.convertAnims() in tools/model-lab.html. hips: 'full' keeps the clip's hips height, 'crouchOnly' keeps only dips below standing (the physics owns body height). rootXZ: 'detrend' removes the travel but keeps the sway, 'strip' removes all of it. armSpread: degrees to turn the arms outwards (clearance for the broad chest). armRest 'align': correct the model's A-pose arms to the source T-pose before applying the clip. mirror: also write <name>M, the left/right mirror image. hand: measure which hand reaches for the web.",
